###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Energy RMSE and relative force errors versus training-set size (Figs. 8-9), F:E weight ratio (Fig. 7) and epochs (Figs. 5-6) are figure-only. The fractions of structures with errors below 1 kcal/mol (82% force-trained, 46% energy-trained) are not MAE/RMSE metrics.
# - Zero-point energies and harmonic frequencies (force-trained ZPE within 0.5 kcal/mol; energy-trained off by 6.9, 5.4 and 13.6 kcal/mol) are property errors.
# - The AEV follows Smith et al. (ANI-1, ref. 80), so the models are mapped to the registry method ANI.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/devereux2024.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
